# LF everywhere, on every OS: Windows checkouts get the same bytes as macOS and Linux, so scripts
# that parse source (config-docs.mjs) and the release build see identical files. PowerShell reads
# LF scripts fine, so the .ps1 files are LF too.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary: never converted or diffed as text.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.webp binary
*.ico binary
*.icns binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.wav binary
*.mp3 binary
*.ogg binary
*.gguf binary
*.onnx binary
*.bin binary
*.node binary
*.zip binary
*.pdf binary
